# ---- callouts, heard in the emulator 2026-09-24 (item 163): the runtime's callout / callout_nth
# sites played each id and the game's audio was transcribed: countdown 760 (clips 1-5 said "ONE!", "Cool!", "Three!", "Four!", "Five!"); ten_seconds 761 ("Hurry up!")
callout countdown           760
callout ten_seconds         761
value countdown_first 1

# ---- callouts and text: a start shot for a template mode ----
text example_start_shot     Mini target 1

# ---- events: the framework's event bus, each seen firing in the emulator 2026-09-24 ----
event game_start     0x4d
event ball_start     0x25
event ball_end       0x34
event bonus_start    0x27
event bonus_end      0x28
event tilt_warning   0xc7
event tilt           0xc5
event game_over      0x47

# ---- named inserts (item 164): framework lamp layers, derived from this build's program
#   the slot layout and fade: Godzilla's, checked in the emulator (item 164)
value lamp_slot_size       40
value lamp_slot_level      2
value lamp_slot_alpha      3
value lamp_slot_fade       8
value lamp_slot_used       36
value lamp_group_prio      4
value lamp_group_next      20
value lamp_fade            3
